# ========================================
# Podcast Clip Agent - Environment Variables
# ========================================

# REQUIRED: OpenAI API Keys
# ----------------------------------------
# Both can be the same key

# For AI viral moment detection (GPT-4o-mini)
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-openai-key-here

# For audio transcription (Whisper API)
OPENAI_WHISPER_KEY=sk-your-openai-key-here

# ========================================
# How to Get OpenAI API Key
# ========================================
# 1. Go to: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# 2. Create account (if new)
# 3. Click "Create new secret key"
# 4. Copy and paste above

# ========================================
# Cost Estimates (User Pays)
# ========================================
# Whisper API: ~$0.006 per minute of audio
#   - 10-minute video: ~$0.06
#   - 30-minute video: ~$0.18
#
# GPT-4o-mini: ~$0.0001 per request
#   - Viral detection: ~$0.001
#
# TOTAL per 10-min video: ~$0.07

# ========================================
# Optional: Agent Configuration
# ========================================
# (These are handled by marketplace, not needed in .env)

# Number of clips to create
# NUM_CLIPS=3

# Max clip duration (seconds)
# MAX_DURATION=60

# Min clip duration (seconds)
# MIN_DURATION=15

# Aspect ratio (9:16, 1:1, or 16:9)
# ASPECT_RATIO=9:16

# Virality threshold (1-10)
# VIRALITY_THRESHOLD=7.0

# ========================================
# Security Notes
# ========================================
# - NEVER commit this file to Git!
# - Keep your OpenAI API key secure
# - Set spending limits in OpenAI dashboard
# - The marketplace NEVER stores these keys
# - They are passed per-request and used in-memory only

# ========================================
# Testing
# ========================================
# Test with SHORT videos first:
# - 2-5 minute videos for initial testing
# - Verify clips are created correctly
# - Check caption quality
# - Then try longer videos (10-20 min)
#
# WARNING: Videos >20 min may timeout!
